# Almond Linux AALDM: packages put into a small package pool on the ISO (not
# installed in the live system). The installer installs the bootloader into
# the new system from this pool (calamares-settings-debian's sources-media and
# bootloader-config steps use the live medium as an apt source), so an
# install works without a network. Task T-0007; owner approval needed.
# Status: untested. Whether live-build's pool layout matches what
# sources-media expects ("deb file:/run/live/medium trixie main") must be
# checked in the first install test.
#if ARCHITECTURE amd64
grub-pc
grub-efi
grub-efi-amd64
grub-efi-amd64-signed
shim-signed
#endif
cryptsetup
cryptsetup-initramfs
keyutils
